steps.message:
`supertux2` now builds cleanly with the four coin fixes. I haven't played the flooded-cave level again, so I haven't watched the result in the game.

To check it, break open that block and look for:
- coins fanning upward on both sides;
- coins sinking slowly once they're in the water;
- coins settling on the floor and staying still;
- Tux picking them up when he touches them.

The underwater fall-speed cap of 80 is my own pick, so adjust it if the drift feels too fast or too slow.
